decision: changes-requested

Five defects remain: legacy markerless reservations can still block dispatch; unreadable same-user processes do not prevent conclusion; concurrent releases can leave an unreceipted duplicate run; the required R6 interruption-and-retry regression is missing; and receipt inspection errors are misreported.

The focused Go tests and `go vet` passed. Strict validation reruns were blocked by the read-only sandbox denying Go temporary and cache writes. Closeout and review checks are deferred because they require a recorded conclusion. The checkout remained clean. POSE draft-check accepted this draft.

